IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ah, guarda chi c'è! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Non restare lì impalata, sirenetta!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Perché non ti siedi?
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Stai tranquilla, non mordo.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Oh oh oh!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Harrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bist du's, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Was stehste denn so rum wie
'n Deckschrubber?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Setz dich!
Wenn du ständig nur hin und her
läufst, {{TAG:0003:0002:}}hält dich noch jemand für
'ne Landkrabbe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Harrr, harrr!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aha, senmişsin {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Ne haber küçük{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
hanım? Denizde yolunu kaybetmiş
yengeç gibi görünüyorsun! Yar{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
har har!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Aye, little lady, here to get yerself
a cup o' bean brew?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'd love to treat ye to a cup,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} but the
wife has me on a strict budget{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Dime, lubina de agua dulce,
¿también fondeas por aquí
en busca de un sabroso café?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Me encantaría invitarte a una taza,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
pero mi señora me ha restringido
el presupuesto{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Di' un po', sirenetta... Sei qui
per berti una bella spremuta
di chicchi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mi piacerebbe offrirtene una io,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
ma mia moglie mi sta facendo
i conti in tasca{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}J'ai comme l'impression que tu me
suis un peu partout, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Désolé de te décevoir, mais je suis
un homme marié{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Haste dich etwa extra
herbewegt, um mich zu sehen?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Wenn du so weitermachst, wird
meine Frau noch ganz eifersüchtig,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
harrr, harrr!{{TAG:0003:0024:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Süt mü?{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} Normal{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} miktarda. Hayatta{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
da kahvede de{{TAG:0003:0023:}} ölçüyü{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
kaçırmayacaksın, yar.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Since it's summer{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ye should come
play on the island or something,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
little lady.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}I'll give ye a ride on me boat.
It be havin' a flag and everything...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}J'aime danser sous la pluie !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Danser, et boire du café. Car la
pluie intensifie l'arôme du café.{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Pas
vrai, {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Robusto {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Regentage auf Deck sind 'ne Freude
für jeden guten Kapitän, jaharrr!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Die tobende See,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} die salzige Gischt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
die Sturzflut von oben...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Danach ist
man mit allen Wassern gewaschen!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Jaharrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} und 'n ordentlicher Kaffee
ist die beste Stärkung dafür!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hab ich recht,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Kofi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weißte, was an Echsen so toll ist?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Die sind klein und biestig, genau
wie ich!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Jarrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 'n guter Kapitän ist im Innern
'n kleiner, biestiger Tyrann, der
gegen die tobende See ankämpft!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nur auf Landgang bekommt der
Tyrann Urlaub.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Sonst würden meine Mädels zu
Hause ihn mir schnell austreiben,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
harr, harr!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Fische sind immer ganz nass und
schuppig,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} fast wie 'ne glitschige
Echse, die kein Feuer spucken kann.
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Harrr?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du hast noch nie 'ne
feuerspuckende Echse gesehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du musst mal die Welt erkunden!
Aber zieh dich feuerfest an, jarrr?{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Harrr, harrr, harrr!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Balıklar da denizin{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
kertenkeleleri sayılır. Tek{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
eksikleri ateş püskürtmemeleri!
Belki{{TAG:0003:001B:}} derinlerde vardır. Denizci{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
dediğin araştırır,{{TAG:0003:0002:}} yar.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Che mi prenda un tonno... In tutti
questi anni di vita di mare non ho
mai visto una sirena!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Tutti mi dicono che è colpa mia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
perché non sono un vero lupo
di mare... {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Fandonie!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Queste sirene hanno proprio
la puzza sotto il naso!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Che restino nei loro fondali!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Şu üç boyutlu teknoloji{{TAG:0003:0002:}} acayip
şey. Hanım{{TAG:0003:0000:}} da hep {{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:01CD}}der ki...{{TAG:000D:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Gerçi tek{{TAG:0003:0009:}} göz bandıyla üç boyutu{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
anlamak biraz zor, yar.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Per tutti i coralli! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Hai un taglio{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
di capelli... {{TAG:0003:0027:}}molto sbarazzino!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Una fanciulla col taglio indovinato
è come il canto di una sirena
per un lupo di mare come me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Keşke benim de seninki kadar
saçım olsaydı. Deniz rüzgârı
yıllar içinde çoğunu götürdü{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
yar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
Sai, sirenetta, prima di iniziare
il mio lavoro attuale ho fatto
tante altre cose.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Sono stato autista d'autobus,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
tassista{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} e anche rematore.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Quello sì che era un lavoraccio!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Remavo avanti e indietro cento
volte al giorno,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} anche con la pioggia!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beh, più o meno come faccio ora.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ma per i miei clienti questo e altro!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Soprattutto per le mie clienti...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehm, per la mia famiglia, ovvio!

{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehi, {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Prepara una bella
spremuta di chicchi per questa
sirenetta! {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Metti pure sul mio conto!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Kofi,{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} mein Bester...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wieso machste
dem netten Fräulein nich' 'ne
Tasse Kaffee auf meine Kosten?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
